   "lines": [
    "In the morning I",
    "drove Alice through the",
    "beautiful country round",
    "about here. In the",
    "afternoon we all",
    "went out sailing.",
    "In the evening we",
    "went over to Uncle",
    "Jim's. The cousins",
    "and everyone are",
    "just too sweet for",
    "anything. Douglas",
    "Robinson and Romy",
    "Colgate are also staying",
    "with us, so there is",
    "quite a large party",
    "in the house."
   ],
